                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is Dubai the right first international market for a jewellery brand?</h3>
                                        <p>For most India-based brands, yes. Dubai has world's highest per-capita jewellery spend + strong Indian diaspora + DIFC / Free Zone setup ease. Typical entry timing: after ₹8-15 Cr ARR in India.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does WhatsApp integration for jewellery cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Platform (Wati/Interakt): ₹2K-30K/month. Business API setup: ₹50K-2 lakh one-time. Custom video-showroom flow: ₹5-15 lakh. Pays back within 60-90 days for high-ticket brands.</p>
                                        <h3>Should new brands do gold or diamond?</h3>
                                        <p>For India: gold has scale + tradition, diamond D2C growing. For USA / UK: lab-grown diamond has best margin + growth. UAE: both massive.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a healthy jewellery brand CAC?</h3>
